Z||000017||StuGood||02-10-2001||06:19 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Coconut:<BR><B>...Even if it snows this weekend FieroGTGirl has got me firing up the barbecue! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>...if it does snow, that will suck!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I've been known to BBQ out in the garage doorway while it's pouring outside, myself!   By the way, maybe you can blame me for the snow... brought it with me from Wichita?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  ||||reg||12
